---
import LayoutEn from '../../layouts/LayoutEn.astro';
---

<LayoutEn title="Privacy Policy & Affiliate Disclosure | VPP TINH">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 border-b-2 border-primary pb-3">Privacy Policy & Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
            
            <div class="prose prose-sm sm:prose-base text-gray-700 max-w-none">
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">1. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
                <p>
                    VPP TINH is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
                </p>
                <p>
                    As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. This means that if you click on an affiliate link on our website and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>. This helps support our efforts in bringing you the best Zen and Buddhist curations.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>
                    We do not collect any personal data directly through user accounts, as our website serves as a curated catalog. However, we may collect non-personally identifiable information such as browser type, operating system, and anonymous usage statistics through standard analytics tools to improve our website experience.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">3. External Links & Third-Party Platforms</h2>
                <p>
                    Our website contains links to external platforms (such as Amazon). Once you click these links and leave our site, you are governed by the Privacy Policy and Terms of Service of those respective platforms. We do not have access to your payment details, address, or personal shipping information.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
                <p>
                    We may use cookies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small text files stored on your device. Third-party partners (like Amazon) may also use cookies to track affiliate referrals. You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings.
                </p>

                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">5. Contact Us</h2>
                <p>
                    If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our B2B Wholesale operations, please contact us via our official WhatsApp channel provided on the website.
                </p>
                
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-8 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4"><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</LayoutEn>